
# 🔍 Lost and Found Management System

A web-based Lost and Found Management System developed using Node.js, Express.js and SQLite. The application helps users report lost and found items, search for missing belongings, and identify possible matches through a centralized platform.

## 📌 Project Overview

The Lost and Found Management System provides a simple and efficient way to manage lost and found belongings.

Users can register, log in, report lost or found items, upload item images, and search for reported belongings. The system also provides an admin dashboard to manage users and item reports.

## 🎯 Objectives

- To provide a centralized platform for lost and found items.
- To make reporting lost and found belongings easier.
- To help users search for missing items.
- To identify matching lost and found items.
- To provide secure user authentication.
- To allow administrators to manage users and item reports.

## ✨ Features

### User Features
- User Registration
- Secure User Login
- User Dashboard
- Report Lost Items
- Report Found Items
- Upload Item Images
- View Lost Items
- View Found Items
- Search Items by Name and Category
- Automatic Lost and Found Item Matching
- User Logout

### Admin Features
- Admin Login
- Admin Dashboard
- View Total Registered Users
- View Total Lost Items
- View Total Found Items
- Manage Registered Users
- View Lost Item Reports
- View Found Item Reports
- Delete Lost and Found Item Reports
- Admin Logout

